Calculation Of The Plane Image Electric Field (
\begin_inset Formula $\vec{E}_{I_{plane}}$
\end_inset

)
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand formatted
reference "fig:Vector-schematic-for-plane-image"
