 illustrates the schematic vector layout used to evaluate the electrostatic field contribution originating from the image charge of the grounded boundary plane located at 
\begin_inset Formula $\vec{P}_{plane}=d\hat{z}$
\end_inset

 where 
\begin_inset Formula $d$
\end_inset

 is the gap distance.
 The differential element (
\begin_inset Formula $dq_{sp}$
\end_inset

) within the localized space charge distribution is specified at spatial coordinate 
\begin_inset Formula $\vec{P}_{dq_{sp}}=rsin(\theta)cos(\phi)\hat{x}+rsin(\theta)sin(\phi)\hat{y}+\left(rcos(\theta)+R\right)\hat{z}$
\end_inset

 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand eqref
reference "eq:p_dq_sp_position"
plural "false"
