tuple "list"

\end_inset

 via spherical representation relative to the conductor tip (apex),
 where 
\begin_inset Formula $R$
\end_inset

 denotes the hemispherical tip radius and 
\begin_inset Formula $r$
\end_inset

,
 
\begin_inset Formula $\theta$
\end_inset

,
 
\begin_inset Formula $\phi$
\end_inset

 are the internal local cloud coordinates.
 All remaining spatial distribution parameters retain their previously defined definitions.
